; Used by the hand-written `vm_audio_driver_entry_switch` test: two audio
; entries whose samples encode `t`, so switching the driver between them
; proves both that the entry changes and that the sample position is
; preserved across the switch (an entry switch is a live-performance move,
; not a restart).

@audio
(defn f [t: f32]: f32
  t)

@audio
(defn g [t: f32]: f32
  (- 0. t))

@cpu
(defn main [])
